{"suttaId":"tha-ap425","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[116,190],"vripara":"36"},"segments":{"tha-ap425:0.3":"Ekāsanadāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap425:1.1":"“Himavantassāvidūre, gosito nāma pabbato;","tha-ap425:1.3":"Assamo sukato mayhaṃ, paṇṇasālā sumāpitā.","tha-ap425:2.1":"“Nārado nāma nāmena, kassapo iti maṃ vidū;","tha-ap425:2.3":"Suddhimaggaṃ gavesanto, vasāmi gosite tadā.","tha-ap425:3.1":"“Padumuttaro nāma jino, sabbadhammāna pāragū;","tha-ap425:3.3":"Vivekakāmo sambuddho, agañchi anilañjasā.","tha-ap425:4.1":"“Vanagge gacchamānassa, disvā raṃsiṃ mahesino;","tha-ap425:4.3":"Kaṭṭhamañcaṃ paññāpetvā, ajinañca apatthariṃ.","tha-ap425:5.1":"“Āsanaṃ paññāpetvāna, sire katvāna añjaliṃ;","tha-ap425:5.3":"Somanassaṃ paveditvā, idaṃ vacanamabraviṃ.","tha-ap425:6.1":"“‘Sallakatto mahāvīra, āturānaṃ tikicchako;","tha-ap425:6.3":"Mamaṃ rogaparetassa [rāga …(syā.)], tikicchaṃ dehi nāyaka.","tha-ap425:7.1":"“‘Kallatthikā ye passanti, buddhaseṭṭha tuvaṃ mune;","tha-ap425:7.3":"Dhuvatthasiddhiṃ papponti, etesaṃ ajaro [jajjaro (sī. pī. ka.)] bhave.","tha-ap425:8.1":"“‘Na me deyyadhammo atthi, pavattaphalabhojihaṃ;","tha-ap425:8.3":"Idaṃ me āsanaṃ atthi [na me deyyaṃ tava atthi (sī. syā.)], nisīda kaṭṭhamañcake’.","tha-ap425:9.1":"“Nisīdi tattha bhagavā, asambhītova [acchambhitova (syā. ka.)] kesarī;","tha-ap425:9.3":"Muhuttaṃ vītināmetvā, idaṃ vacanamabravi.","tha-ap425:10.1":"“‘Visaṭṭho [vissattho (sī. pī), vissaṭṭho (syā. ka.)] hohi mā bhāyi, laddho jotiraso tayā;","tha-ap425:10.3":"Yaṃ tuyhaṃ patthitaṃ sabbaṃ, paripūrissatināgate [paripūrissatāsanaṃ (syā. ka.)].","tha-ap425:11.1":"“‘Na moghaṃ taṃ kataṃ tuyhaṃ, puññakkhette anuttare;","tha-ap425:11.3":"Sakkā uddharituṃ attā, yassa cittaṃ paṇīhitaṃ [sunīhitaṃ (syā.)].","tha-ap425:12.1":"“‘Imināsanadānena, cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;","tha-ap425:12.3":"Kappasatasahassāni, vinipātaṃ na gacchasi.","tha-ap425:13.1":"“‘Paññāsakkhattuṃ devindo, devarajjaṃ karissasi;","tha-ap425:13.3":"Asītikkhattuṃ rājā ca, cakkavattī bhavissasi.","tha-ap425:14.1":"“‘Padesarajjaṃ vipulaṃ, gaṇanāto asaṅkhiyaṃ;","tha-ap425:14.3":"Sabbattha sukhito hutvā, saṃsāre saṃsarissasi’.","tha-ap425:15.1":"“Idaṃ vatvāna sambuddho, jalajuttamanāmako;","tha-ap425:15.3":"Nabhaṃ abbhuggamī vīro, haṃsarājāva ambare.","tha-ap425:16.1":"“Hatthiyānaṃ assayānaṃ, sarathaṃ sandamānikaṃ;","tha-ap425:16.3":"Labhāmi sabbamevetaṃ, ekāsanassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap425:17.1":"“Kānanaṃ pavisitvāpi, yadā icchāmi āsanaṃ;","tha-ap425:17.3":"Mama saṅkappamaññāya, pallaṅko upatiṭṭhati.","tha-ap425:18.1":"“Vārimajjhagato santo, yadā icchāmi āsanaṃ;","tha-ap425:18.3":"Mama saṅkappamaññāya, pallaṅko upatiṭṭhati.","tha-ap425:19.1":"“Yaṃ yaṃ yonupapajjāmi, devattaṃ atha mānusaṃ;","tha-ap425:19.3":"Pallaṅkasatasahassāni, parivārenti maṃ sadā.","tha-ap425:20.1":"“Duve bhave saṃsarāmi, devatte atha mānuse;","tha-ap425:20.3":"Duve kule pajāyāmi, khattiye atha brāhmaṇe.","tha-ap425:21.1":"“Ekāsanaṃ daditvāna, puññakkhette anuttare;","tha-ap425:21.3":"Dhammapallaṅkamādāya [dhammapallaṅkamaññāya (syā. ka.)], viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap425:22.1":"“Satasahassito kappe, yaṃ dānamadadiṃ tadā;","tha-ap425:22.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, ekāsanassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap425:23.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap425:24.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap425:25.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap425:26.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā ekāsanadāyako thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap425:27.1":"Ekāsanadāyakattherassāpadānaṃ tatiyaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
